  "hints": [
    "Each single edit can insert a char, delete a char, or substitute one char for another.",
    "Base cases: transforming an empty string to length j costs j insertions. Transition: 0 extra cost when a[i-1] == b[j-1], else 1 + min(delete, insert, replace).",
    "Pseudocode:\n  prev = list(range(len(b) + 1))\n  for i, ca in enumerate(a, 1):\n      cur = [i] + [0] * len(b)\n      for j, cb in enumerate(b, 1):\n          cur[j] = prev[j-1] if ca == cb else 1 + min(prev[j], cur[j-1], prev[j-1])\n      prev = cur"
  ],
